# Production build config for the tailnet dev site (committed — not secret).
#
# vite build (production mode) bakes these into dist/. VITE_API_URL is the
# canonical, same-origin base the served UI calls, so a browser on any tailnet
# member hits sentinel.dev.russalo.com/api (proxied by Caddy to 127.0.0.1:8001)
# instead of its own localhost. See docs/WORKSPACE.md § "Building the dev site".
VITE_API_URL=https://sentinel.dev.russalo.com/api
